I'll create the necessary components and update the Desktop and UI store to support opening channels and media library as panels.

## Plan:
1. Create `TeamChannel.vue` - channel view component
2. Create `TeamDM.vue` - direct message view component  
3. Create `TeamMediaLibrary.vue` - media library component
4. Update `Desktop.vue` to register new components
